{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/Shop_GIF.gif?t=1753047889\" /></div>Build a team of JRPG inspired units with unique abilities. You will need to strategically place and synergize the characters to be successful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/Battle_Gif_3.gif?t=1753047889\" /></div>Battles play turns automatically, where units use their special abilities on specific triggers. There are many unique strategies and powerful synergies to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A</strong>ysnc Multiplayer AND Single Player Roguelite\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge the Mirrored Legion in a run based rogue lite mode where each run is modified by meta shifting trinkets.<br><br>Or challenge your party comp skills against other player's parties in Arena Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockables!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new characters, items, trinkets, and factions after each run.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520490?t=1753047889","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753047889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753047889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753047889","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":